#: startlistsources/__init__.py:101
msgid "Start List Source"
msgstr "Startlistkälla"

#: startlistsources/__init__.py:104
msgid "Determines the source of the Start List to look up team information from."
msgstr "Bestämmer startlistkällan som används för att slå upp laginformation."

#: startlistsources/start_list_source_file.py:240
msgid "File Start List Source"
msgstr "Filbaserad Startlistkälla"

#: startlistsources/start_list_source_file.py:243
msgid ""
"Reads a start list file following the <a "
"href=\"https://orienteering.sport/iof/it/data-standard-3-0/\">IOF 3.0 "
"Data Standard</a> and uses it to look up the team bib number and relay "
"leg. Files generated by <a "
"href=\"https://www.orientering.se/forening/arrangor/tavlingsadministration/ola/\">OLA</a>"
" and <a href=\"https://sportsoftware.de/orienteering/os\">OS12</a> have "
"been tested.The file will be monitored and re-read if it changes."
msgstr ""
"Läser en startlistfil enligt <a href=\"https://orienteering.sport/iof/it"
"/data-standard-3-0/\">IOF 3.0 Data Standard</a> och använder den för att "
"slå upp lagets nummerlapp och sträcka. Filer genererade av <a "
"href=\"https://www.orientering.se/forening/arrangor/tavlingsadministration/ola/\">OLA</a>"
" och <a href=\"https://sportsoftware.de/orienteering/os\">OS12</a> har "
"testats. Filen övervakas och läses om vid ändringar."

#: startlistsources/start_list_source_file.py:253
msgid "Start List File"
msgstr "Startlistfil"

#: startlistsources/start_list_source_file.py:256
msgid "The path on the file system where the start list file is located."
msgstr "Sökvägen i filsystemet där startlistfilen finns."

#: startlistsources/start_list_source_file.py:264
msgid "Start List Update Sound"
msgstr "Ljud vid startlistuppdatering"

#: startlistsources/start_list_source_file.py:267
msgid "The path to the sound file to use when the start list is updated."
msgstr "Sökvägen till ljudfilen som spelas när startlistan uppdateras."

#: startlistsources/start_list_source_meos.py:22
msgid "MeOS Information Server Start List Source"
msgstr "MeOS Informationsserver Startlistkälla"

#: startlistsources/start_list_source_meos.py:25
msgid ""
"Looks up team bib number and relay leg from a running <a "
"href=\"https://www.melin.nu/meos/\">MeOS</a> instance via its Information"
" Server REST API. MeOS must have the Information Server enabled (Services"
" → Information Server). If the received punch data already contains the "
"bib number and leg, no operation will be performed."
msgstr ""
"Slår upp lagets nummerlapp och sträcka från en körande <a "
"href=\"https://www.melin.nu/meos/\">MeOS</a>-instans via dess "
"Informationsserver REST API. MeOS måste ha Informationsservern aktiverad "
"(Automater → Informationsserver). Om mottagen stämplingsdata redan "
"innehåller nummerlapp och sträcka utförs ingen operation."

#: startlistsources/start_list_source_ola_mysql.py:21
msgid "OLA MySQL Start List Source"
msgstr "OLA MySQL Startlistkälla"

#: startlistsources/start_list_source_ola_mysql.py:24
msgid ""
"Looks up the team bib number and relay leg from the MySQL database used "
"by the <a href=\"https://www.svenskorientering.se/Arrangera"
"/itochtavlings-administration/OLAtidtagnings-program/\">OLA event "
"organizing software</a>. OLA must be using MySQL as the database engine, "
"the built-in database is not supported. If the received punch data "
"already contains the bib number and leg no operation will be performed."
msgstr ""
"Slår upp lagets nummerlapp och sträcka från MySQL-databasen som används "
"av <a href=\"https://www.svenskorientering.se/Arrangera/itochtavlings-"
"administration/OLAtidtagnings-program/\">tävlingsadministrationsprogramet"
" OLA</a>. OLA måste använda MySQL som databasmotor, den inbyggda "
"databasen stöds inte. Om mottagen stämplingsdata redan innehåller "
"nummerlapp och sträcka utförs ingen operation."

